# Vision + dialogue/tool-use (action planning) + audio understanding
# ("STT") + audio generation ("TTS") -- all via Gemini's free tier
# (Flash models), no credit card required.
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides. The defaults are the models this submission was
# tested against; leave these commented unless your account requires a
# different available model.
# GEMINI_LIVE_MODEL=gemini-3.8-live
# GEMINI_VISION_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# GEMINI_TTS_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts
# CHARACTER_LAMP_MIC_RMS_THRESHOLD=60
